flowchart TD
  subgraph lane_commercial["LANE 1 - COMMERCIAL / MER / CUSTOMER"]
    s01_sales["1. Sales Pitch / Market Understanding<br>Purpose: identify opportunity, trend, target price, customer direction.<br>Coverage: AI-assisted intelligence<br>[[E-commerce Market Intelligence v.2.3]]<br>> Canonical: MER.MARKET.INTELLIGENCE.v1.2"]
    s08_quote_review["8. Quotation Review / Negotiation<br>Review target price, margin, assumptions, alternatives, risk.<br>Coverage: decision support<br>> [[PPJ.COSTING.AGENT.PLATFORM.v1.1]]<br>> [[FIN.AI.FINANCE.MANAGEMENT.v1.1]]<br>Gap: quote approval workflow and assumption versioning."]
    s09_po["9. PO / Order Confirmation<br>Confirm PO, style, quantity, delivery, price and commitment.<br>Coverage: workflow automation / historical support<br>> [[MER.PO-Commit]]<br>Canonical: MER.PO.Commit.v1.1"]
    s02_request["2. Customer Request / RFQ<br>Inputs: email, RFQ, techpack, sample image, target price, timeline.<br>Coverage: partly AI-assisted, mostly manual<br><br>Gap: intake normalization agent."]
    s07_costing["7. Costing / Quotation<br>Agentic costing uses upstream inputs:<br>CPD + FD + TD + SEW + Consumption + Denim-only Wash.<br>Coverage: LLM-assisted / agentic decision support<br>> [[PPJ.COSTING.AGENT.PLATFORM.v1.1]]"]
  end
  subgraph lane_material["LANE 2 - CREATIVE / FABRIC / TECHNICAL / SOURCING / PURCHASING"]
    s03_cpd["3. Creative Product Design / 3D Visual Library<br>Pre-costing design reference, image search, sample library.<br>Coverage: data repository / search<br>> [[CPD.Datamart.v1.1]]<br>Output: design/style reference for costing."]
    s06_inputs["6. SEW / Consumption / Denim-only Wash Inputs<br>SEW: construction, manpower, SMV/SAM if available.<br>Consumption: fabric/trim/yield/wastage.<br>Wash: denim or wash-required only.<br>Coverage: partial / input readiness gap<br>> [[TD.TechnicalPlatform_v2.1]]<br>> [[FD.Datamart.v2.2]]<br>> [[WASH.SAMPLING.MANAGEMENT.PORTAL.v1.1]]<br>> [[PROD.COWASH]]"]
    s11_purchasing["11. Purchasing / Allocation / Indent / GDI / Inventory<br>Transaction workflow, allocation, indent, GDI, inventory, label processing.<br>Coverage: automation / workflow / reporting<br>> [[PUR.Material.Allocation.v1.2]]<br>> [[PUR.GDI Automation]]<br>> [[PUR.Adhoc Indent mien Nam]]<br>> [[PUR.Inventory Report]]<br>> [[PUR.H&M Label-O Processing]]"]
    s10_sourcing["10. Sourcing / Supplier / Material Intelligence<br>Supplier, material, sample, search, sourcing history.<br>Coverage: LLM chatbot / data search<br>> [[SCP.SOURCING.CHATBOT.v2.3]]<br>Boundary: intelligence, not purchasing transaction."]
    s12_grn["12. Material Receiving / Warehouse / GRN<br>Receive goods, GRN, supplier invoice matching, WFX reconciliation.<br>Coverage: bot automation / invoice utility<br>> [[ACC.GRN-SupplierInvoiceBot.v2.3]]<br>> [[PPJ.Invoice Downloader.v1.2]]"]
    s04_fd["4. Fabric <br>Fabric identity, hanger, QR, fabric visibility and material reference.<br>Coverage: Directus repository / QR<br>> [[FD.Datamart.v2.2]]<br>Output: fabric/material reference for costing."]
    s05_td["5. Technical Knowledge / BOM / Pattern / Construction<br>BOM, pattern, measurement, sewing method, technical docs.<br>Coverage: knowledge platform / possible RAG<br>> [[TD.TechnicalPlatform_v2.1]]<br>Output: technical feasibility for costing."]
  end
  subgraph lane_finance_ai["LANE 4 - FINANCE / AI PLATFORM / REPORTING"]
    s20_ai_platform["20. Cross-Process AI / Platform / Helpdesk Layer<br>Not a linear stage. Supports approved search, access, orchestration and IT helpdesk.<br><br>[[PPJ.AI.Hub.v2.1]] = app discovery/access<br>[[PPJ.PERRI.Chatbot]] = controlled conversational orchestration<br>[[PPJ.GLPI-Helpdesk-AI Chatbot]] = IT support knowledge<br><br>Rule: domain owner approves data; AI assists, user approves action."]
    s19_finance["19. Finance / Accounting / Reporting / Management Insight<br>ERP, WFX, DWH, invoice, GRN, costing plan, sales efficiency, profitability.<br>Coverage: AI-assisted analytics / automation<br>> [[FIN.AI.FINANCE.MANAGEMENT.v1.1]]<br>> [[ACC.GRN-SupplierInvoiceBot.v2.3]]<br>> [[PPJ. Expense-Invoices.v1.1]]<br>> [[PPJ.Invoice Downloader.v1.2]]"]
    s18_exim["18. EXIM / Shipping Documents / Expense Invoice<br>Shipping docs, service invoices, department/factory/ledger mapping.<br>Coverage: automation utility / EXIM-first processing<br>> [[PPJ. Expense-Invoices.v1.1]]<br>> [[PPJ.Invoice Downloader.v1.2]]"]
  end
  subgraph lane_factory["LANE 3 - FACTORY / WASH / QC / SHIPPING"]
    s17_shipping["17. Packing / Final Warehouse / Shipping Readiness<br>Finished goods, QC pass, packing list, carton, shipping instruction, EXIM handoff.<br>Coverage: current gap / indirect support only<br>Gap: Shipping Readiness Dashboard."]
    s13_planning["13. Production Planning / Factory Preparation<br>Order readiness, material readiness, line plan, manpower, sewing method.<br>Coverage: partial production visibility<br>> [[PROD.IOT.CHuyenTreo_1]]<br>Gap: costing assumptions -> production plan bridge."]
    s16_qc["16. QC / TQM / Traceability<br>Inspection, defect detection, customer quality, RFID/product ID exploration.<br>Coverage: AI inspection PoC / RFID feasibility<br>> [[PPJxQSee.ai]]<br>> [[PPJ XPrimo1D RFID Thread]]<br>> ![[Pasted image 20260715140648.png]]"]
    s15_wash["15. Wash / R&D Wash / Operational Wash<br>Sampling request/trial/result/approval/history and operational wash output/delay/rework.<br>Coverage: workflow portal / operational data<br>> [[WASH.SAMPLING.MANAGEMENT.PORTAL.v1.1]]<br>> [[PROD.COWASH]]"]
    s14_production["14. Production Execution / Cut /  Sewing Line<br>Track output, target, downtime, efficiency and operational progress.<br>Coverage: IoT / dashboard<br>> [[PROD.IOT.CHuyenTreo_1]]<br>---CUT - AUTOMATION"]
  end
